# LF everywhere, in the index and in every working copy — this overrides
# core.autocrlf, which is set to true here and would otherwise hand a
# checkout CRLF files. docker/start.sh and the Dockerfile are read by a
# Linux container, where a CRLF shebang fails with
# "/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter". text=auto leaves real binaries
# (*.wasm, *.nnue, images, fonts) alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
